<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Quiksilver raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Quiksilver raised to buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dillon Read said it upgraded Quiksilver Inc to buy from outperform, citing the company's strong sales and backlog trends.</p>
<p>-- Expects Quiksilver to report 15-20 percent sales and earnings gains. Said the company &quot;is one of the better performing surf apparel companies.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Raised 18-month price target to $37 per share from $33 based on 17-times 1998 earnings estimate of $2.20 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 2-1/8 to 30-5/8.</p>
</text>
